/* ================= AIRBRUSH PAINT EFFECT =================
   Painted the way a board is really airbrushed: hard edges are masked with tape and paper first; the colour goes on
   in long, even, overlapping passes that start and finish off the board, in light coats that build up; fades are
   sprayed from the light side towards the dark side, pulling the gun back to feather; then the tape is peeled.
   With the switch off, colours apply instantly. */
var SPRAY={on:false,run:null};   /* off unless the visitor switches it on */
